<title>GERMANY: Spar 9-mo operating profit up 18.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Spar 9-mo operating profit up 18.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   59.1    vs 49.8</p>
<p>    Group sales				  9,245   vs 9,207</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retail group is Spar Handels-AG.</p>
